# Feature: library explorer (Phase 10)

Sidebar `#folder-list`: `Mixed` first, then existing legal class folders from `list_library`. Never invent a folder picker of all 521 AudioSet names.

Main `#file-list`: WAV name, duration, tags. Empty folder shows a short message.

Mutations go through `window.soundly.call` only:

- Move: dropdown of **other folders that already exist**. No free-text dest (blocks non-AudioSet names). Does not re-run YAMNet.
- Rename: basename prompt → `rename_file`.
- Delete: confirm → `delete_file`.

Keep the selected folder across `list_library` refresh when it still exists. Show errors in `#library-error`. No Chromium playback in MVP (32-bit float WAV often will not play).
